 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Erdős Problem 408: distribution of iterated totient heights",
  "excerpt": "This Lean 4 project concerns [Erdős Problem 408](https://www.erdosproblems.com/408), as cataloged by Thomas F. Bloom. Let `φ_k` be the `k`-th iterate of Euler's totient function, and let `f(n)` be the least `k ≥ 1` with `φ_k(n) = 1`. Erdős asked whether `f(n) / log n` has a distribution function, and whether it is almost always constant."
 },
